BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 528.55 Tm (100,000-email operator warns that high-volume senders typically land in spam) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 513.32 Tm (within two weeks, and has watched agencies lose every inbox overnight by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 498.10 Tm (parking them all on one provider, which is why 200 inboxes get split 67 Google,) Tj ET
