BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 452.42 Tm (that SMTP through Mail Reef has no built-in cap but more variance, and that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 437.20 Tm (warm-up is not a cure-all because it cannot save you from spam reports) Tj ET
