BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 300.17 Tm (build demands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 45.00 284.95 Tm (Dirty data is the second silent killer. At 35,000 leads, a list that is 95% accurate) Tj ET
